                "user_message": "What is Shakers about?",
                "assistant_message": "Shakers is a platform that connects clients with freelance talent across various disciplines, including Development & IT, Design & Creative, Writing & Content, Marketing & Sales, and Business & Consulting [Document: Freelancers on Shakers]. The platform offers powerful tools and features to help clients find the perfect freelancer for their projects through advanced search filters, AI-powered matching, and comprehensive freelancer profiles [Document: Finding the Right Talent on Shakers]. Additionally, Shakers prioritizes security and privacy by offering multiple authentication methods, session management features, and account recovery options [Document: Security and Privacy on Shakers]. The platform aims to create a comprehensive environment for successful freelance collaboration, allowing both clients and freelancers to achieve their goals efficiently and securely [Document: Shakers Platform Features].",
